<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Playboy recommended.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Playboy recommended.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz said analyst Stewart Halpern initiated coverage of Playboy Enterprises Inc and put the stock on its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- set price target of $16 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- shares closed on Monday up 1/8 to 12-1/2.</p>
</text>
